ber after your result. With a customer in the chair, his attention is on them, not on the phone. It'll be the same when it's you in the chair. The reception finds you an appointment; let them know about a change or cancellation as soon as you can.","Môžem si vybrať barbera?":"Can I choose my barber?","Áno, svojho barbera si vyberieš v rezervácii.":"Yes, you choose your barber when you book.","Strihate aj deti?":"Do you cut kids' hair?","Áno, detský strih (strih pre malých gentlemanov) je pre chlapcov do 10 rokov: klasický strih alebo fade, umytie a styling.":"Yes, the kids' haircut (little gentlemen's cut) is for boys up to 10: a classic cut or fade, a wash and styling.","Robíte bradu a holenie britvou?":"Do you do beards and razor shaves?","Áno: úpravu brady s horúcim uterákom a britvou, holenie do hladka Hot Towel aj farbenie brady.":"Yes: beard trims with a hot towel and razor, the Hot Towel clean shave and beard colouring.","Sú ceny v cenníku konečné?":"Are the prices in the price list final?","Áno, ceny v cenníku sú konečné.":"Yes, the prices in the price list are final.","Farbíte aj vlasy?":"Do you colour hair too?","Farbenie, melír a trvalú robí Romana. Rezervuješ ich samostatne cez Booqme, kde nájdeš aj ich ceny.":"Colouring, highlights and perms are done by Romana. You book them separately on Booqme, where you'll also find their prices.","Čo ak nestihnem prísť?":"What if I can't make it?","Daj nám vedieť čo najskôr na 0951 267 203, v pracovné dni od 9:00 do 19:00 telefón vždy zdvihneme.":"Let us know as soon as you can on 0951 267 203, on weekdays from 9:00 to 19:00 we always pick up.","Čo ma čaká, keď prídem?":"What happens when I arrive?","Pri dverách ťa privíta recepčná. Vzadu v čakárni máš kávu alebo minerálku zdarma. V kresle začína konzultácia, potom strojček, nožnice a fade, pri brade horúci uterák a britva. Na záver styling a kolínska.":"The receptionist greets you at the door. In the waiting area at the back there's free coffee or mineral water. In the chair it starts with a consultation, then clippers, scissors and a fade; for the beard, a hot towel and a razor. Styling and cologne to finish.","Čo ak nebudem spokojný?":"What if I'm not happy with it?","Z kresla vstaneš, až keď si spokojný. Čo nesedí, povedz rovno v kresle: dohodneme a doladíme hneď. Všetko ostatné rieši recepcia: 0951 267 203, v pracovné dni od 9:00 do 19:00 telefón vždy zdvihneme.":"You get up from the chair only when you're happy. Whatever doesn't sit right, say so right there in the chair: we agree on it and fix it on the spot. Everything else goes through the reception: 0951 267 203, on weekdays from 9:00 to 19:00 we always pick up.","Kedy máte otvorené?":"When are you open?","Pondelok až piatok 9:00–19:00, sobota 9:00–14:00, v nedeľu zatvorené.":"Monday to Friday 9:00–19:00, Saturday 9:00–14:00, closed on Sunday.","Prehrať prehliadku":"Play the tour","Zastaviť prehliadku":"Stop the tour","Ďalej":"Next"}
