d hair regeneration.","Salón 30":"Salón 30","Kaderníctvo a wellness pre vlasy: strihy, farbenie a koloristika, trichologické vyšetrenie.":"Hair salon and hair wellness: cuts, colouring and colour work, trichological examination.","Pánske strihy, brada a holenie britvou. Si tu.":"Men's haircuts, beard and razor shave. You're here.","Povedali o nás":"What customers say","Objednať sa":"Book now","Zavolať a potvrdiť termín":"Call to confirm a time","Zavolať a potvrdiť termín: 0951 267 203":"Call to confirm a time: 0951 267 203","5,0 na Google · 945 recenzií":"5.0 on Google · 945 reviews","Pánsky strih 18 €":"Men's haircut €18","Objednaj sa online kedykoľvek. Alebo zavolaj na recepciu: v pracovné dni od 9:00 do 19:00 telefón vždy zdvihneme.":"Book online any time. Or call the front desk: on weekdays from 9:00 to 19:00 we always pick up.","Rezervácia | Barbershop 30 Nitra":"Booking | Barbershop 30 Nitra","Online rezervácia v Barbershop 30 na Mostnej 30 v Nitre: vyber si službu, barbera a voľný čas. Alebo zavolaj na 0951 267 203.":"Book online at Barbershop 30, Mostná 30 in Nitra: pick a service, a barber and a free time. Or call 0951 267 203.","Vyber si službu, barbera a voľný čas. Mostná 30, Nitra.":"Pick a service, a barber and a free time. Mostná 30, Nitra.","Barbershop 30 Nitra – na web":"Barbershop 30 Nitra – to the website","Vyber si službu, barbera a voľný čas. Alebo zavolaj na recepciu: v pracovné dni od 9:00 do 19:00 telefón vždy zdvihneme.":"Pick a service, a barber and a free time. Or call the front desk: on weekdays from 9:00 to 19:00 we always pick up.","Vybrať službu":"Choose a service","Rezervácia termínu":"Book a time","Vyber si službu":"Choose a service","Termín dokončíš v rezervačnom systéme Barbershopu 30 alebo telefonicky.":"You finish the booking in the Barbershop 30 booking system or by phone.","Späť na web":"Back to the website","Komu zveríš hlavu?":"Who do you trust with your head?","Naša práca":"Our work","Pozri, ako strihá náš tím":"See how our team cuts","Viac na Instagrame @barbershop30_nitra":"More on Instagram @barbershop30_nitra","Rezervuj si miesto":"Book your seat","Pánsky strih 18 €, objednaj sa":"Men's haircut €18, book now","Káva čaká, vyber si čas":"Coffee's waiting, pick a time","Vyber si svojho barbera":"Choose your barber","Pozri celý cenník":"See the full price list","Príď to zažiť, objednaj sa":"Come and see it, book now","Objednaj sa online":"Book online","Grafický dizajn a web:":"Graphic design and website:","Barbershop 30 Nitra | Pánske holičstvo, Mostná 30":"Barbershop 30 Nitra | Men's barbershop, Mostná 30","Pánske holičstvo na Mostnej 30 v Nitre: strih, fade, úprava brady a holenie britvou, káva zdarma. Objednaj sa online alebo zavolaj.":"Men's barbershop at Mostná 30 in Nitra: haircuts, fades, beard trims and straight razor shaves, free coffee. Book online or call us.","Pánske holičstvo na Mostnej 30. Strih, úprava brady aj holenie britvou, káva zdarma.":"Men's barbershop at Mostná 30. Haircuts, beard trims and razor shaves, coffee on the house.","Než prídeš":"Before you come","Časté otázky":"Frequently asked questions","Ako sa objednám?":"How do I book?","Online kedykoľvek: vyberieš si službu, barbera a voľný čas. Alebo zavolaj na 0951 267 203, v pracovné dni od 9:00 do 19:00 telefón vždy zdvihneme.":"Online any time: pick a service, a barber and a free time. Or call 0951 267 203, on weekdays from 9:00 to 19:00 we always pick up.","Mám volať barberovi alebo recepcii?":"Should I call the barber or the reception?","Vždy recepcii: 0951 267 203, v pracovné dni od 9:00 do 19:00 telefón vždy zdvihneme. Recepčná sa stará o tvoj termín a pohodlie, barber o tvoj výsledok. Keď má v kresle zákazníka, venuje sa jemu, nie telefónu. Tak to bude, aj keď v kresle sedíš ty. Recepcia ti termín nájde, zmenu či zrušenie jej daj vedieť čo najskôr.":"Always the reception: 0951 267 203, on weekdays from 9:00 to 19:00 we always pick up. The receptionist looks after your appointment and your comfort, the barber after your result. With a customer in the chair, his attention is on them, not on the phone. It'll be the same when it's you in the chair. The reception finds you an appointment; let them know about a change or cancellation as soon as you can.","Môžem si vybrať barbera?":"Can I choose my barber?","Áno, svojho barbera si vyberieš v rezervácii.":"Yes, you choose your barber when you book.","Strihate aj deti?":"Do you cut kids' hair?","Áno, detský strih (strih pre malých gentlemanov) je pre chlapcov do 10 rokov: klasický strih alebo fade, umytie a styling.":"Yes, the kids' haircut (little gentlemen's cut) is for boys up to 10: a classic cut or fade, a wash and styling.","Robíte bradu a holenie britvou?":"Do you do beards and razor shaves?","Áno: úpravu brady s horúcim uterákom a britvou, holenie do hladka Hot Towel aj farbenie brady.":"Yes: beard trims with a hot towel and razor, the Hot Towel clean shave and beard colouring.","Sú ceny v cenníku konečné?":"Are the prices in the price list final?","Áno, ceny v cenníku sú konečné.":"Yes, the prices in the price list are final.","Farbíte aj vlasy?":"Do you colour hair too?","Farbenie, melír a trvalú robí Romana. Rezervuješ ich samostatne cez Booqme, kde nájdeš aj ich ceny.":"Colouring, highlights and perms are done by Romana. You book them separately on Booqme, where you'll also find their prices.","Čo ak nestihnem prísť?":"What if I can't make it?","Daj nám vedieť čo najskôr na 0951 267 203, v pracovné dni od 9:00 do 19:00 telefón vždy zdvihneme.":"Let us know as soon as you can on 0951 267 203, on weekdays from 9:00 to 19:00 we always pick up.","Čo ma čaká, keď prídem?":"What happens when I arrive?","Pri dverách ťa privíta recepčná. Vzadu v čakárni máš kávu alebo minerálku zdarma. V kresle začína konzultácia, potom strojček, nožnice a fade, pri brade horúci uterák a britva. Na záver styling a kolínska.":"The receptionist greets you at the door. In the waiting area at the back there's free coffee or mineral water. In the chair it starts with a consultation, then clippers, scissors and a fade; for the beard, a hot towel and a razor. Styling and cologne to finish.","Čo ak nebudem spokojný?":"What if I'm not happy with it?","Z kresla vstaneš, až keď si spokojný. Čo nesedí, povedz rovno v kresle: dohodneme a doladíme hneď. Všetko ostatné rieši recepcia: 0951 267 203, v pracovné dni od 9:00 do 19:00 telefón vždy zdvihneme.":"You get up from the chair only when you're happy. Whatever doesn't sit right, say so right there in the chair: we agree on it and fix it on the spot. Everything else goes through the reception: 0951 267 203, on weekdays from 9:00 to 19:00 we always pick up.","Kedy máte otvorené?":"When are you open?","Pondelok až piatok 9:00–19:00, sobota 9:00–14:00, v nedeľu zatvorené.":"Monday to Friday 9:00–19:00, Saturday 9:00–14:00, closed on Sunday.","Prehrať prehliadku":"Play the tour","Zastaviť prehliadku":"Stop the tour","Ďalej":"Next","Pozri bližšie":"Take a closer look"}
